# NAVALIVAY Project - AI Agent Guidelines

## Project Overview
E-commerce Telegram Mini App with admin panel (CRM). Stack: Vue 3 + Vite (frontend), Express + SQLite (backend).

## Server Info
- **Domain**: https://navalivay.store
- **Hosting**: TimeWeb Cloud (SPB-3)
- **IP**: 89.191.229.34
- **OS**: Ubuntu 22.04 LTS
- **RAM**: 4 GB
- **Node.js**: 20.x
- **SSL**: Let's Encrypt (auto-renew via certbot.timer)

---

## 🟢 Performance Optimizations (January 2026)

The project has been optimized for performance. Key metrics:

| API Endpoint | Response Time | Response Size |
|--------------|---------------|---------------|
| `/api/products` | ~10-20 ms | ~24 KB |
| `/api/categories` | ~10-20 ms | ~18 KB |
| `/api/categories/:id/image` | ~5 ms | ~100-140 KB |
| `/api/product/:id` | ~3-5 ms | varies |
| `/api/admin/crm/products/search` | ~50-100 ms | ~50-100 KB |

**Architecture:**
- Category/group cover images are NOT included in list responses
- Images are loaded separately via dedicated endpoints and cached on frontend
- Products with `needsCategoryImage: true` flag use category cover image
- All images automatically converted to WebP format (800x800px, quality 80%, preserves transparency)
- CRM product search does NOT return base64 images (only image URLs)

